# Large data files — never push these
data/processed/
data/patches/
data/raw/

# Model weights — publish via Zenodo or GitHub Releases instead
checkpoints/*.pt

# Jupyter checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.jupyter/

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Environment
.env
*.egg-info/
```

**What DOES get pushed:**
```
✓ notebooks/          — all 5 notebooks
✓ models/             — vegformer.py
✓ training/           — train_pipeline.py
✓ configs/            — pretrain_config.yaml, study_area.geojson
✓ data/gee/           — export scripts
✓ visualization/      — folium_dashboard.py
✓ outputs/maps/       — PNG figures
✓ outputs/dashboards/ — vegformer_mara.html
✓ requirements.txt
✓ README.md
✓ .gitignore